      "activity_name": "Create Tuple Payload Load Generator (U4)",
      "activity_description": "Develop a standalone command-line tool or script (e.g., a Java main class or JMeter test plan) that generates a specified number of messages with a standard `Tuple` payload and publishes them to a given Kafka topic. It should report basic metrics (total sent, rate).",
